"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.45.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">December 10th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Snow Trees</b> are <b>trees</b> that have bark of a white color, with transparent dark blue leaves that <b>almost</b> appear <b>glass like</b>. <b>Snow Trees</b> are located in the <a href=\"/wiki/Icelands\" title=\"Icelands\"><b>Icelands</b></a>, previously located in <b>Snowlands</b> prior to <a href=\"/wiki/Version_1.71.0\" title=\"Version 1.71.0\"><b>Christmas Update 2024</b></a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The <b>Original</b> <b>Snow Tree</b> design was changed to a <b>newer</b> version made by <b>Jak</b> (who was a <b>developer in trial</b> at the time).</li>\n<li>The <b>Snow Tree</b>'s <b>wood</b> when <b>sanded</b> is the first <b>wood</b> in the game to have slippery <b>physics</b> applied to them, similarly to <b><a href=\"/wiki/Quartz\" title=\"Quartz\">Quartz</a></b> and its <b><a href=\"/wiki/Rosa_Flama_Quartz\" title=\"Rosa Flama Quartz\">Pink Variant</a>,</b> and <b><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Frost_Wood\">Frost</a></b> Wood from <i><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Lumber_Tycoon_2_Wiki\">Lumber Tycoon 2</a></i>. <b>Sanded Snow wood</b> will slide around and the distance will depend on the amount of force applied to them.</li>\n<li>The <b>Snow</b> <b>Tree</b>'s design is similar to <a href=\"/wiki/Blue_Pine\" title=\"Blue Pine\"><b>Blue Pine</b></a>.</li>\n<li>The Snow Tree requires <b>Tier 2 Equipment</b> for processing<b>.</b></li>\n<li>Despite being far easier to obtain, the <b>Snow Tree</b> is worth more than the <a href=\"/wiki/Suiratcal\" title=\"Suiratcal\">Suiratcal</a>.</li></ul>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"69ac7964252065f186899331c8d2c458\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"SnowTree-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:SnowTree.png\" title=\"SnowTree.png (124 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f5/OldSnowTree.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240312150235\" title=\"SnowTree.png (124 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Old Snow Tree\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"OldSnowTree.png\" data-image-key=\"OldSnowTree.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Old Snow Tree\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"SnowTree.png (124 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Old Snow Tree\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"OldSnowTree.png\" data-image-key=\"OldSnowTree.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Old Snow Tree\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f5/OldSnowTree.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240312150235\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Old Snow Tree</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"New_Snow_Tree-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:New_Snow_Tree.png\" title=\"New Snow Tree.png (110 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/58/New_Snow_Tree.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240724043511\" title=\"New Snow Tree.png (110 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"New Snow Tree\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"New Snow Tree.png\" data-image-key=\"New_Snow_Tree.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"New Snow Tree\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"New Snow Tree.png (110 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"New Snow Tree\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"New Snow Tree.png\" data-image-key=\"New_Snow_Tree.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"New Snow Tree\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/58/New_Snow_Tree.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240724043511\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">New Snow Tree</div></div></div>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Snow Tree (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6U25vd19UcmVlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\"><s